    "title": "Pets Of The Week: Meet Roxy And Petunia - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Submitted by ,\n14 hours ago Roxy has the gentle disposition of a woodland creature and the general silhouette of someone who has never encountered a snack she didn’t feel morally obligated to investigate. One eye went all in on blue; the other is keeping things casual. This 4yo 90lb mix of mystery breeds loves her people, loves a good walk, loves being outside, and is happiest when she has somewhere to go and someone important to go there with. Read full article\n1",
